---
import Button from '../components/blocks/Button.astro';
import Img from '../components/blocks/Img.astro';
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Section from '../components/Section.astro';
import Shape from '../components/blocks/Shape.astro';
import Text from '../components/blocks/Text.astro';
import img16 from '../assets/images/16.png';
import img18 from '../assets/images/18.png';
import gradient2 from '../assets/images/gradient-2.png';
import gradientD81605ea from '../assets/images/gradient-d81605ea.png';
import kaboompicsFlashPhotographyAestheticOfWom from '../assets/images/kaboompics-flash-photography-aesthetic-of-woman-typing-on-laptop-on-black-leather-sofa-39797.jpg';
import kaboompicsNotebookOrganizerPencilWriting from '../assets/images/kaboompics-notebook-organizer-pencil-writing-32247.jpg';
import pexelsArinaKrasnikova6016372 from '../assets/images/pexels-arina-krasnikova-6016372.jpg';
import pexelsShkrabaanthony5306438 from '../assets/images/pexels-shkrabaanthony-5306438.jpg';
import socialShare6a8726b0 from '../assets/images/social-share-6a8726b0.png';
---

<Layout title="Content Marketing for Therapists | HelloSEO" description="Discover SEO-optimized content strategies with HelloSEO's Content Hub to attract and engage your ideal clients through expert blog creation and digital marketing support." ogImage={socialShare6a8726b0} footerOffset="2vw" headerTheme="white">
  <Section theme="white" bg={{ src: kaboompicsNotebookOrganizerPencilWriting, overlay: 0.9, parallax: true, eager: true }} grid={{ rows: [35, 27], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Text m="3/2/8/10" d="4/7/8/21" z={2} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>SEO OPTIMIZED BLOGS</strong></p>
      <h1 class="ta-center">What exactly is a <span class="c-lightAccent">content hub</span>?</h1>
    </Text>
    <Text m="8/2/15/10" d="8/7/12/21" z={3} align="center">
      <p class="large ta-center">Google and AI's robots are constantly mining the internet for authoritative, expert content that cuts through the noise and offers a trustworthy answer to the questions people are asking.</p>
      <p class="large ta-center">The more you can establish yourself as a credible source, the more those search engines will serve up your content, and the more trust you can build with your potential client before they even reach out to book a session. Our Content Hub makes that happen.</p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="17/1/36/11" d="16/1/26/27" z={4} align="center" fill="var(--darkAccent)" />
    <Img m="16/2/23/10" d="13/3/27/10" z={6} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.4, ease: 'ease-out', frames: [{ r: -4 }, {  }] }] }} outline={{ border: '4px solid #fff', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsShkrabaanthony5306438} alt="Two women sitting on a beige sofa with dark pillows in a room with white walls and large window. One woman with glasses and short hair is taking notes, while the other woman with long dark hair is reading a book. Green plants are visible in the background." radius="30px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 29vw" eager />
    <Text m="24/2/35/10" d="17/12/25/24" z={5} align="center">
      <h3><span class="c-white">The more clear, distinct content you have online, the more likely you are to rank highly in those search results.</span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">These are not generic blog posts. We tap our SEO softwares to conduct keyword research and craft 10+ original blog posts in your voice that showcase your specific expertise, all with the goal of landing more leads in your inbox. </span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="medium" grid={{ rows: [57, 26], rowGap: 11, colGap: 35 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/9/10" d="1/2/6/18" z={1}>
      <h2>Your voice is a differentiator. a HelloSEO Content Hub channels it into SEO-optimized content that performs while feeling like you.</h2>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="10/2/23/10" d="6/18/21/26" z={2} align="center" origin="0% 50%" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="10/2/16/10" d="6/2/14/10" z={11} zm={10} align="center" src={kaboompicsFlashPhotographyAestheticOfWom} alt="Close-up of a person wearing a light blue shirt, sitting at a desk with a laptop, with a smartphone nearby." radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="17/3/22/9" d="15/3/19/9" z={4} zm={3} radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">Keyword Research: </span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">Our team does the deep-dive work on finding the best keywords for your practice, services, and goals. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="23/2/37/10" d="6/2/21/10" z={3} zm={4} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--darkAccent)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="23/2/29/10" d="6/10/14/18" z={6} zm={11} align="center" src={img18} alt="A woman with curly blonde hair, wearing glasses and a black shirt with white line details, is sitting at a wooden table, looking at a tablet. On the table, there is a yellow phone case, a cup of coffee, and a small notepad with a pen. In the background, there are framed pictures on the wall, a green desk lamp, and a potted plant." focal="56.4% 28%" radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="30/3/36/9" d="15/11/20/17" z={7} zm={5} radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">One Hour Interview: </span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">We’ll spend an hour asking you questions, learning about your practice and therapeutic process, and best of all, gathering over 10K+ words in your voice.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Shape m="37/2/52/10" d="11/10/21/18" z={5} zm={6} align="center" origin="0% 50%" fill="var(--mauve)" radius="10px" />
    <Img m="37/2/43/10" d="6/18/14/26" z={12} align="center" src={img16} alt="A wooden table holding a tablet with glasses and a stylus, a pair of sunglasses on the tablet, pink and orange notebooks, two dark glass cups, a glass of iced tea, and some papers and clips." radius="10px 10px 0px 0px" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 33vw" />
    <Text m="44/3/51/9" d="15/19/20/25" z={8} zm={7} radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">Optimized Blogs: </span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">We work with AI to create content that follows the search gold standard of E-E-A-T content: Experience, Expertise, Authoritativeness, and Trustworthiness.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="53/2/55/10" d="22/6/25/22" z={9} zm={8} align="center" alignM="start" radius="30px">
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>More traffic, more leads, more right-fit clients on your couch. </strong></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="56/2/58/10" d="25/11/27/17" z={10} zm={9} align="center" href="/contact">Get started</Button>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" grid={{ rows: [20, 10], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Shape m="3/2/20/10" d="1/3/10/25" z={1} align="center" fill="var(--black)" stroke={{ color: 'var(--mauve)', width: '15px' }} radius="30px" />
    <Img m="1/2/5/10" d="3/23/7/26" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }], alternate: true, iterations: 1 }] }} src={gradientD81605ea} alt="Cute white cat with a curly tail on a purple background. The cat has a smiling face with closed eyes and whiskers." fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 13vw" />
    <Text m="6/3/19/9" d="2/5/9/21" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h3><span class="c-white">“I worked with Jade to get SEO and Blog posts up on my website to start generating organic traffic for my business. </span></h3>
      <p><span class="c-white">She was incredibly knowledgeable and such a dream to work with! Her way of gathering information to write my blogs was perfect for allowing the tone of the copy to sound just like the way I would talk to my clients!”</span></p>
      <p class="large"><span class="c-white"><strong>- COLE W.</strong></span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section height="small" grid={{ rows: [24, 17], rowGap: 22, colGap: 22 }}>
    <Text m="1/2/9/10" d="1/6/7/22" z={1} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center">Designed for practice owners and solo therapists who want to <span class="c-lightAccent">build authority</span> and <span class="c-lightAccent">attract clients</span> through authentic content.</h2>
      <p class="large ta-center">With our Content Hub package, you get:</p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="9/2/14/10" d="7/6/12/14" z={5} zm={3} anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--mauve)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">Custom Blog Content</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">10-12 SEO-optimized blog posts written in your voice, showcasing your expertise and drawing on your real knowledge as a practitioner.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="14/2/19/10" d="7/14/12/22" z={6} zm={4} anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--lightAccent)" padding="6% 6% 6% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">Full Publishing Support</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">We upload every post directly to your website, optimized for SEO from day one.</span></p>
    </Text>
    <Text m="19/2/24/10" d="12/6/17/22" z={7} zm={5} align="center" alignM="start" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'hover', duration: 0.5, ease: 'spring', bounce: 0.3, frames: [{ sx: 1.05, sy: 1.05 }] }] }} bg="var(--darkAccent)" padding="4% 6% 4% 6%" radius="30px">
      <h4><span class="c-white">AI-Ready Content</span></h4>
      <p><span class="c-white">Written to align with how both Google and AI search tools surface expertise, built to keep performing as search evolves.</span></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="bright" grid={{ rows: [16, 13], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/5/10" d="3/12/5/16" z={3} align="center" anim={{ animations: [{ trigger: 'loop', duration: 4, ease: 'ease-in-out', frames: [{ y: '20%', sx: 0.95, sy: 0.95 }], alternate: true, iterations: 1 }] }} src={gradient2} alt="White smiling cat illustration with dark blue background" fit="contain" sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 17vw" />
    <Text m="5/2/16/10" d="5/7/12/21" z={2} zm={1} align="center">
      <h3 class="ta-center">“Working with HelloSEO was a wonderful experience. </h3>
      <p class="ta-center">The team made the process simple, collaborative, and highly effective. I couldn’t be more pleased with the output—the content was spot-on, the execution flawless, and the entire engagement exceeded my expectations. I highly recommend Jade and her team to anyone seeking SEO expertise and turnkey content support.”</p>
      <p class="large ta-center"><strong>- JENICA O.</strong></p>
    </Text>
  </Section>

  <Section theme="white" inset divider={{ height: '2vw', concave: true }} grid={{ rows: [18, 17], rowGap: 11, colGap: 11 }}>
    <Img m="2/2/17/10" d="2/2/16/26" z={1} align="center" outline={{ border: '4px solid #d34320', radius: '34px' }} src={pexelsArinaKrasnikova6016372} alt="A young woman with long, wavy brown hair sitting at a wooden table using a laptop, with open notebooks and a white mug in front of her in a cozy, well-lit room with wooden furniture." focal="54.8% 64.8%" radius="30px" overlay={{ opacity: 1, color: 'hsl(var(--black-hsl) / 0.65)' }} parallax={{ intensity: 20, rotation: 45, zoomStart: 2 }} sizes="(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 100vw" />
    <Text m="4/3/13/9" d="5/9/11/19" z={2} align="center" alignM="start">
      <h2 class="ta-center"><span class="c-white">Your </span><span class="c-accent">expertise and ideas</span><span class="c-white"> deserve to be seen.</span></h2>
      <p class="large ta-center"><span class="c-white">Let's turn what you already know into consistent, compelling content that draws the right clients to you. </span></p>
    </Text>
    <Button m="13/3/15/9" d="12/10/14/18" z={3} align="center" href="/contact">Get Started</Button>
  </Section>
</Layout>
